{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41737274",
      "title": "Working with Server Action Responses & useFormState",
      "sourceHash": "2aac9810bb97426f1eaadff8d865464eaa8290721c669c31bf7917e10fde953a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "So how can we handle validation errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 5.763,
          "en": "like this in a more elegant way?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.14,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "Well, in Server Actions, as we have it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 15.74,
          "en": "you are not limited to redirecting or throwing errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.78,
          "end": 19.8,
          "en": "Instead, you can also return values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.8,
          "end": 23.98,
          "en": "You can return response objects to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.2,
          "end": 26.49,
          "en": "and I'll show you how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.49,
          "end": 30.483,
          "en": "to access those objects in your components in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "So here we could return an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 37.62,
          "en": "which maybe has a message field which holds a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.62,
          "end": 38.943,
          "en": "of invalid input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 42.87,
          "en": "Though the shape of this object is totally up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.87,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "it's just important that it's a serializable object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 50.072,
          "en": "which means it, for example, shouldn't include any methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.072,
          "end": 52.86,
          "en": "because those would get lost whilst",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 54.453,
          "en": "being sent to the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.47,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "But any simple values like strings, numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 63.483,
          "en": "nested objects or nested arrays, those values all work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.98,
          "end": 67.653,
          "en": "So that's how we can return a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.91,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "How can we then use that response in that share page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 74.943,
          "en": "where we trigger that Server Action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.5,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "Well, we can use it with help of another hook, another hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 85.88,
          "en": "provided by React dom, the useFormState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.67,
          "end": 90.813,
          "en": "So not useFormStatus, which we had before, but useFormState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 94.62299999999999,
          "en": "Sounds similar but is a different hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "This hook also must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 101.82300000000001,
          "en": "from React dom like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 107.46000000000001,
          "en": "And then this hook here works a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 107.46000000000001,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "like the useState hook that's built into React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "because this hook is responsible for managing the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "of this page or of this component, which uses a forum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "that will be submitted with help of Server Actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 126.36,
          "en": "And that's precisely the use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 128.76,
          "en": "where useFormState can help you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.76,
          "end": 131.88,
          "en": "because useFormState needs two arguments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 131.88,
          "end": 135.66,
          "en": "And the first argument is the actual Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.66,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "that should be triggered when the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 140.11,
          "en": "in this case shareMeal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 142.02,
          "end": 144.03,
          "en": "The second argument you pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 144.03,
          "end": 149.03,
          "en": "to useFormState is the initial state of this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 149.31,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "and that simply means the initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "that should be returned by useFormState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 158.79,
          "en": "before this action has been triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "and yielded a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "So the initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 165.48,
          "en": "that should be used if we haven't received a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "from this action yet, and that could be anything you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 170.94,
          "en": "for example, null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 173.82,
          "en": "or an object where you have a message field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 176.43,
          "en": "that holds a value of null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.43,
          "end": 180.33,
          "en": "To reassemble the shape of that response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.33,
          "end": 182.103,
          "en": "we will eventually send back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "Eventually I'll send back an object with this shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 187.95,
          "en": "where the message holds a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.95,
          "end": 191.4,
          "en": "So our initial value here could be the same shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.4,
          "end": 193.953,
          "en": "but null as a value for the message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.48,
          "end": 198.63,
          "en": "Then useFormState will give you an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 202.77,
          "en": "with exactly two elements, which might sound familiar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.77,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "because the default useState hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 208.203,
          "en": "provided by React also gives you two elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 212.82,
          "en": "And indeed here the two elements we get here are kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.82,
          "end": 217.11,
          "en": "of similar to the two elements we get from useState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.11,
          "end": 221.31,
          "en": "because we get the current state, the current",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.31,
          "end": 225.57,
          "en": "response you could say, of this page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225.57,
          "end": 227.34,
          "en": "of this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.34,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "So the latest response returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 232.29,
          "en": "by this Server Action in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.29,
          "end": 236.793,
          "en": "or this initial state if no response has been received yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.23,
          "end": 241.38,
          "en": "And we get another formAction here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.38,
          "end": 243.87,
          "en": "which we should actually set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.87,
          "end": 246.333,
          "en": "for this action prop on the form now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.35,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "So instead of setting share meal as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "for action down here, I'm now setting this formAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 257.693,
          "en": "which I'm getting back from useFormState as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.693,
          "end": 259.503,
          "en": "for the action down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 263.46,
          "en": "And this must be done so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 263.46,
          "end": 266.34,
          "en": "that useFormState can basically step in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 266.34,
          "end": 269.52,
          "en": "and manage that state for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 269.52,
          "end": 272.13,
          "en": "And that state depends on the execution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 272.13,
          "end": 275.25,
          "en": "of that Server Action and its response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.25,
          "end": 278.31,
          "en": "And that's why useFormState kind of needs to act",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.31,
          "end": 280.743,
          "en": "as a man in the middle, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.88,
          "end": 284.4,
          "en": "With that, we can then use this state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 284.4,
          "end": 286.86,
          "en": "which will essentially be either this year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 289.364,
          "en": "or any response we got back from ShareMeal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.364,
          "end": 293.463,
          "en": "to output data in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.6,
          "end": 297.81,
          "en": "Now, in this case, I know that state will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.81,
          "end": 301.33,
          "en": "therefore either be an object with a message that's a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 302.58,
          "end": 306.633,
          "en": "or it'll be an object with a message that's null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 307.77,
          "end": 311.37,
          "en": "So we can use it down here at the end of the form right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.37,
          "end": 313.98,
          "en": "before the submit button, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.98,
          "end": 316.263,
          "en": "to output an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.18,
          "end": 322.713,
          "en": "For that, we can check if state.message is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.588,
          "end": 325.05,
          "en": "which means we have a message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 328.35,
          "en": "And in that case I wanna output it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 328.35,
          "end": 330.033,
          "en": "between my paragraph tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 334.59000000000003,
          "en": "Now with that, we also need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.59000000000003,
          "end": 337.38,
          "en": "to tweak the shareMeal action though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.38,
          "end": 341.43,
          "en": "because when passing it as a value to useFormState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.43,
          "end": 344.463,
          "en": "it must have a different shape than it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 349.44,
          "en": "It should no longer just accept that form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.44,
          "end": 353.25,
          "en": "Instead, it should now actually accept two parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.25,
          "end": 356.55,
          "en": "because useFormState will pass two parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 356.55,
          "end": 359.37,
          "en": "to shareMeal when it executes it when the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 359.37,
          "end": 360.633,
          "en": "form gets submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.59,
          "end": 365.64,
          "en": "The second parameter will still be that submitted data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 365.64,
          "end": 368.913,
          "en": "but the first parameter will be the previous state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.75,
          "end": 372.96,
          "en": "So either that initial state that we set up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 372.96,
          "end": 375.347,
          "en": "or any other previous responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 375.347,
          "end": 379.89,
          "en": "that might have been generated, I don't care about it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 379.89,
          "end": 381.51,
          "en": "but still we need to accept it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 381.51,
          "end": 383.91,
          "en": "because form data is now the second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.91,
          "end": 385.683,
          "en": "we get, not the first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 388.17,
          "end": 390.78,
          "en": "With that though, we got everything set up that needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 390.78,
          "end": 394.23,
          "en": "to be set up, but we'll now get an error if we try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.23,
          "end": 399.06,
          "en": "to load the page because useFormState, since it in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.06,
          "end": 402.63,
          "en": "again deals with updating the client, needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 402.63,
          "end": 407.63,
          "en": "to be executed in a client component and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 410.88,
          "en": "we should add use client here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 410.88,
          "end": 413.703,
          "en": "in our shareMeal page component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 415.29,
          "end": 418.14,
          "en": "We could again try to outsource this into some nested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 418.14,
          "end": 421.29,
          "en": "component, but here I'll stick to this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 421.29,
          "end": 424.083,
          "en": "add use client and save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 425.07,
          "end": 427.74,
          "en": "And with that, this is looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 427.74,
          "end": 429.96,
          "en": "We got no error and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 429.96,
          "end": 433.98,
          "en": "therefore now we can try submitting an invalid form again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 433.98,
          "end": 437.59,
          "en": "So here, I'll enter some data like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 438.45,
          "end": 441.55,
          "en": "and if I now inspect my email field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 441.55,
          "end": 445.68,
          "en": "and I remove the required prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 445.68,
          "end": 450.273,
          "en": "and I click share meal, I now get this error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 452.07,
          "end": 455.19,
          "en": "Now of course we could make it pop more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 455.19,
          "end": 457.38,
          "en": "We could make sure that it stands out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 457.38,
          "end": 462.36,
          "en": "that it's more descriptive and you can do all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 462.36,
          "end": 464.395,
          "en": "You can, for example, tweak that message here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 464.395,
